---
description: Assess distinctive reporting value and feasibility before selecting an issue portfolio.
args:{brief:IssueBrief;pitches:StoryPitch[];existing:Commission[]}
returns:PitchAssessment[]
---
Compare every pitch's angle against issue goals, audience, known contributor work and the reporting plan. Mark access as viable, conditional or unproven from supplied evidence. Link pitches that substantially duplicate angle or reporting sources. Preserve dependencies, contributor capacity and formats; do not reward topic interest as if it proved a reportable story.
